WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.227 --> 00:00:00.526
JOHN.

00:00:00.527 --> 00:00:01.961
&gt;&gt; John: PERHAPS HE WILL STAY

00:00:01.962 --> 00:00:02.928
AROUND FOR A WHILE YET.

00:00:02.929 --> 00:00:03.696
KRISTIN FISHER AT THE

00:00:03.697 --> 00:00:04.997
WHITE HOUSE FOR US.

00:00:04.998 --> 00:00:05.564
THANKS.

00:00:05.565 --> 00:00:06.232
WHILE THE LABOR SECRETARY IS

00:00:06.233 --> 00:00:08.234
STAYING FOR NOW, BRITAIN'S

00:00:08.235 --> 00:00:08.968
AMBASSADOR TO THE UNITED STATES

00:00:08.969 --> 00:00:11.370
IS OUT.

00:00:11.371 --> 00:00:12.371
KIM DEREK RESIGNED TODAY AFTER

00:00:12.372 --> 00:00:15.074
PRESIDENT TRUMP ESSENTIALLY

00:00:15.075 --> 00:00:15.941
GHOSTED HIM OVER SECRET

00:00:15.942 --> 00:00:18.878
CRITICISM THAT BECAME PUBLIC.

00:00:18.879 --> 00:00:19.545
REPORTER KITTY LOGAN HAS THE

00:00:19.546 --> 00:00:21.514
LATEST FORCE FROM LONDON

00:00:21.515 --> 00:00:21.847
TONIGHT.

00:00:21.848 --> 00:00:24.049
&gt;&gt; UNDER FIRE FROM

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:25.551
PRESIDENT TRUMP AND PERSONA

00:00:25.552 --> 00:00:27.520
NON GRATA IN THE WHITE HOUSE,

00:00:27.521 --> 00:00:28.187
KIM DEREK SAID THE CURRENT

00:00:28.188 --> 00:00:28.921
SITUATION MADE IT IMPOSSIBLE TO

00:00:28.922 --> 00:00:30.422
STAY ON.

00:00:30.423 --> 00:00:33.325
ADDING "THE RESPONSIBLE HORSE IS

00:00:33.326 --> 00:00:35.227
TO ALLOW THE APPOINTMENT OF A

00:00:35.228 --> 00:00:36.161
NEW AMBASSADOR.

00:00:36.162 --> 00:00:36.862
ADDRESSING PARLIAMENT TODAY,

00:00:36.863 --> 00:00:39.398
PRIME MINISTER THERESA MAY GAVE

00:00:39.399 --> 00:00:41.367
THE EMBATTLED AMBASSADOR OR

00:00:41.368 --> 00:00:42.167
BACKING.

00:00:42.168 --> 00:00:43.168
&gt;&gt; I TOLD HIM THAT IT IS A

00:00:43.169 --> 00:00:43.903
MATTER OF GREAT REGRET THAT HE

00:00:43.904 --> 00:00:46.605
HAS FELT IT NECESSARY TO LEAVE

00:00:46.606 --> 00:00:49.008
HIS POSITION.

00:00:49.009 --> 00:00:52.211
SIR KIM HAS GIVEN A LIFETIME OF

00:00:52.212 --> 00:00:53.212
SERVICE TO THE UNITED KINGDOM

00:00:53.213 --> 00:00:54.346
AND WE OWE HIM AN ENORMOUS DEBT

00:00:54.347 --> 00:00:56.348
OF GRATITUDE.

00:00:56.349 --> 00:00:59.852
&gt;&gt; BUT THAT GRATITUDE COMES AT

00:00:59.853 --> 00:01:00.519
AN EXPENSE.

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:02.054
IN A PARLIAMENTARY COMMITTEE

00:01:02.055 --> 00:01:02.821
HEARING EARLIER TODAY, THE HEAD

00:01:02.822 --> 00:01:04.623
OF BRITISH DIPLOMATIC SERVICE

00:01:04.624 --> 00:01:07.159
SAID THE RISK BETWEEN THE TWO

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:09.562
ALLIES WAS THE WORST IN OVER A

00:01:09.563 --> 00:01:09.895
CENTURY.

00:01:09.896 --> 00:01:11.196
&gt;&gt; THE LAST TIME THAT I KNOW

00:01:11.197 --> 00:01:15.467
THAT WE HAVE DIFFICULTY WITH

00:01:15.468 --> 00:01:16.468
UNITED STATES WAS 1856.

00:01:16.469 --> 00:01:18.604
WHEN THE INCUMBENT WAS ACCUSED

00:01:18.605 --> 00:01:21.440
OF RECRUITING AMERICANS TO FIGHT

00:01:21.441 --> 00:01:22.074
ON THE BRITISH SIDE IN THE

00:01:22.075 --> 00:01:24.410
CRIMEAN WAR.

00:01:24.411 --> 00:01:25.911
&gt;&gt; IN A TWEET YESTERDAY,

00:01:25.912 --> 00:01:26.579
PRESIDENT TRUMP CALLED THE

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:29.114
AMBASSADOR A VERY STUPID GUY AND

00:01:29.115 --> 00:01:29.848
ON MONDAY TWEETED THAT HE NO

00:01:29.849 --> 00:01:33.252
LONGER WANTED TO DEAL WITH DEREK

00:01:33.253 --> 00:01:35.087
AND DISINVITED HIM FROM A STATE

00:01:35.088 --> 00:01:35.988
DINNER.

00:01:35.989 --> 00:01:37.756
THE PRESIDENT'S COMMENTS CAME

00:01:37.757 --> 00:01:39.892
AFTER A LEAK OF CONFIDENTIAL

00:01:39.893 --> 00:01:40.626
BRITISH EMBASSY MEMOS IN WHICH

00:01:40.627 --> 00:01:42.428
DEREK DESCRIBES THE TRUMP

00:01:42.429 --> 00:01:44.930
ADMINISTRATION AS INAPT AND

00:01:44.931 --> 00:01:46.565
DYSFUNCTIONAL.

00:01:46.566 --> 00:01:49.668
&gt;&gt; I THINK WHOEVER LEAKED HIS

00:01:49.669 --> 00:01:50.636
DETAILS HAS REALLY DONE A GREAT

00:01:50.637 --> 00:01:52.905
DISSERVICE TO OUR CIVIL

00:01:52.906 --> 00:01:55.741
SERVANTS, DO PEOPLE HAVE GIVEN

00:01:55.742 --> 00:01:58.377
ADVICE TO MINISTERS.

00:01:58.378 --> 00:01:59.378
&gt;&gt; KIM DEREK WILL FORMULA

00:01:59.379 --> 00:02:01.013
STEPPED ON ONCE HIS SUCCESSOR IS

00:02:01.014 --> 00:02:01.380
APPOINTED.

00:02:01.381 --> 00:02:02.314
WHILE THE GOVERNOR MAY NOT HAVE

00:02:02.315 --> 00:02:03.949
WANTED THE AMBASSADOR TO RESIGN,

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:05.150
IT WILL SURELY BE HOPING THAT

00:02:05.151 --> 00:02:05.918
HIS DEPARTURE BRINGS THE MATTER

00:02:05.919 --> 00:02:08.988
TO AN END.

00:02:08.989 --> 00:02:09.955
&gt;&gt; STILL MIGHT BE EMBARRASSING

00:02:09.956 --> 00:02:10.556
LEAK IS URGENTLY BEING

00:02:10.557 --> 00:02:10.990
INVESTIGATED.

00:02:10.991 --> 00:02:13.092
THE GOVERNMENT SAYS IT'S HAD

00:02:13.093 --> 00:02:13.759
INITIAL CONVERSATIONS WITH

00:02:13.760 --> 00:02:14.526
POLICE, ALTHOUGH THEY HAVE NO

00:02:14.527 --> 00:02:16.929
FORMAL INQUIRY YET.

00:02:16.930 --> 00:02:17.630
IT'S THOUGHT THAT ONLY A FEW

00:02:17.631 --> 00:02:19.231
PEOPLE COULD HAVE HAD ACCESS TO

00:02:19.232 --> 00:02:22.035
SUCH HIGH-LEVEL CONFIDENTIAL

